    {
      "source": "Returns whether the property is explicitly marked as an identifier property of the owning <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/mapping/PersistentEntity.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.mapping\"><code>PersistentEntity</code></a>.\nA property is an explicit id property if it is annotated with @see <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/annotation/Id.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.annotation\"><code>Id</code></a>.",
      "translation": "返回该属性是否被显式标记为所属 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/mapping/PersistentEntity.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.mapping\"><code>PersistentEntity</code></a> 的标识符属性。\n如果某个属性被 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/annotation/Id.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.annotation\"><code>Id</code></a> 注解标记，则该属性为显式 id 属性。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Returns whether the property is a <a href=\"DocumentReference.html\" title=\"annotation interface in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.mapping\"><code>DocumentReference</code></a>. If this returns true you can expect\n<a href=\"MongoPersistentProperty.html#getDocumentReference()\"><code>MongoPersistentProperty.getDocumentReference()</code></a> to return an non-null value.",
      "translation": "返回该属性是否为 <a href=\"DocumentReference.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.mapping 中的注解接口\"><code>DocumentReference</code></a>。如果此方法返回 true，则可以预期 <a href=\"MongoPersistentProperty.html#getDocumentReference()\"><code>MongoPersistentProperty.getDocumentReference()</code></a> 将返回一个非 null 值。",
